// The Case File supplies the dossier, the council debates the alternatives, and the Architect turns the findings into short (0 to 24 months), medium (3 to 5 years) and long (5 to 15 years and beyond) statecraft initiatives across diplomatic, soft-power, hard-power (lawful, defensive, consent-based), economic, technological and regional pillars.
// Boundary, stated in the prompt and in the screen: influence is not control. The Architect analyses other actors' use of proxies and the lawful countermeasures; it does not design the use of non-state armed groups, covert action, arming or directing proxies, or deniable operations for the UAE. The scope guard still refuses such requests.
